msgstr "什么？我做了什么？"

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xeb57be/0x000000
msgid "She's gonna launch a nuke! "
msgstr "她要发射核弹！"

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xeb57be/0x000001
msgid "Snake, we've got to stop her, whatever it takes."
msgstr "SNAKE，必须阻止她，不惜代价。"

#: slot/0x00db94df/0xeb57be/0x000002
